### tr with unquoted words repeating a letter
tr foo bar < story.txt
>>> SC2020 1:4

### tr with single-quoted words repeating a letter
tr 'hello' 'world' < greeting.txt
>>> SC2020 1:4

### mapping vowels to underscores has no repeated letters
tr aeiou _____ < sentence.txt
>>> none

### squeeze option with two-letter sets is fine
tr --squeeze-repeats rl lr < input.txt
>>> none

### non-literal tr sets are skipped
tr "$from_chars" "$to_chars" < data.txt
>>> SC2154 1:19
>>> SC2154 1:5

### posix class names are not words
tr '[:upper:]' '[:lower:]' < shout.txt
>>> none
